{
  "name": "SatQuery Agent Evaluation - internal frozen evaluation (G15)",
  "note": "NOT an external benchmark. 50 frozen missions over local demo fixtures. Metrics measure the PLANNER + POLICY + EXECUTOR (plan validity, tool selection, dependency validity, mission completion, evidence/verification retention, unsupported-action rate, recovery, unnecessary tool calls, early-stop efficiency, latency) - NOT model accuracy. Each mission encodes what a CORRECT agent SHOULD DO, never the exact answer.",
